/1598210/extras/a58b0ccdb47786a9f0110e0ab22f51ac.mp4?t=1727271400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Simple controls, fast mechanics! Jump, slide, dash, win!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598210/extras/75c524c4c65c016d9515b7605091d55d.poster.avif?t=1727271400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598210/extras/75c524c4c65c016d9515b7605091d55d.webm?t=1727271400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598210/extras/75c524c4c65c016d9515b7605091d55d.mp4?t=1727271400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
